[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_PARADROP]
Drop Zone

[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_PARADROP_desc]
Edelweiss, Edelweiss, every morning you greet me ~
Small and many, armed and ready, you look happy to shoot me ~

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_PARADROP]
伞降舱

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_PARADROP_desc]
雪绒花，雪绒花，清晨迎接我开放 ~
小而多，武装者，冲着他们快开枪 ~
